# Fallback allow-list for the raw Atlassian MCP (route-to-punakawan.sh).
#
# The hook denies raw Atlassian tools by default and steers the model to the
# mcp__punakawan__* equivalents. List here the raw tools Punakawan does NOT
# cover, so they remain usable as a fallback. One entry per line; glob patterns
# (*, ?) allowed; text after # is ignored.
#
# Full tool names look like: mcp__claude_ai_Atlassian__<toolName>
# Run /mcp in Claude Code to see the exact connected names.
#
# Examples (uncomment / edit to widen the fallback as you find gaps):
#
# mcp__claude_ai_Atlassian__getConfluencePage         # rich Confluence page reads
# mcp__claude_ai_Atlassian__getConfluencePageDescendants
# mcp__claude_ai_Atlassian__searchConfluenceUsingCql  # CQL search (no punakawan equiv)
# mcp__claude_ai_Atlassian__getTeamworkGraphContext   # Teamwork Graph relationships
# mcp__claude_ai_Atlassian__*Compass*                 # Compass ops (glob)
